#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:1
msgid "Changning AI Industry Projects, 2026"
msgstr "2026长宁人工智能产业项目"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:4
msgid "Grant | Changning"
msgstr "补助｜长宁区"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:6
msgid "Closed"
msgstr "已截止"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S107 <https://www.shcn.gov.cn/col5713/20260306/1306521.html>`_. "
"上海市长宁区人民政府-长宁区财政局-工作动态-2026年度长宁区人工智能产业项目申报指南."
msgstr "`证据 S107 <https://www.shcn.gov.cn/col5713/20260306/1306521.html>`_. 上海市长宁区人民政府-长宁区财政局-工作动态-2026年度长宁区人工智能产业项目申报指南."

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:13
msgid ""
"Project-specific support after assessment; no common ceiling established"
msgstr "项目经评估给予支持，未确定统一上限"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:20
msgid ""
"Lawfully established Changning legal or non-legal-person organizations "
"with normal operations and good credit. The call covers multiple AI, "
"software, technology-service and market-development directions."
msgstr "长宁依法设立、经营正常且信用良好的法人和非法人组织，覆盖人工智能、软件、科技服务及市场拓展等方向。"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:22
msgid "Closed 30 June 2026"
msgstr "已于2026年6月30日截止"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://www.shcn.gov.cn/col5713/20260306/1306521.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://www.shcn.gov.cn/col5713/20260306/1306521.html>`_"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所链主管部门或运营方联系，本档案未核实现任项目直接联系人。"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../funding/changning-ai-2026.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
